          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Title**: Visual scheduler for managing program times"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-21",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Description**: Drag-and-drop scheduling tool for assigning content to time blocks. Support recurring and one-off shows."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-22",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Labels**: `frontend`, `feature`, `broadcasting`"
